  {"id": "cli.full_help", "translation": "m - XiaoMi MIoT + Mina CLI (OAuth 2.0)\n\nUSAGE\n  m <command> [args...]\n\nAUTH\n  login              First run OAuth 2.0 login, complete authorization in browser to save token\n\nDEVICE\n  Specify device via config default_did or env MI_DID (device_id or name)\n  mina commands (except mina) require device\n  Config files: .config.yaml, config.yaml, ~/.config/miflow/config.yaml, ~/.miflow.yaml\n\nNLU (natural language control, requires Ollama)\n  ask <text>        Control devices with natural language, e.g. m ask turn on living room light\n\nMINA (XiaoAi speaker / voice device)\n  mina              List Mina devices (no device required)\n  message <text>    Device TTS speaks the text\n  play <url>        Play audio from URL (once)\n  pause             Pause playback\n  stop              Stop playback (same as pause)\n  loop <url>        Loop play URL\n  play_list <file>  Play URLs from file in order (one per line, # for comment)\n  suno              Play Suno trending list (requires network)\n  suno_random       Random play Suno list (requires network)\n\nMIoT / MiIO (device properties & control)\n  list [name] [getVirtualModel] [getHuamiDevices]\n                    List devices, filter by name, include virtual/huami\n  spec [model] [format]\n                    Query MIoT spec, format: text|python|json\n  spec_all           Get SPEC for all models from m list (same as spec-all)\n  decode <ssecurity> <nonce> <data> [gzip]\n                    Decode MIoT encrypted data\n\n  siid-piid         Get props, e.g. m 1,1-2,1-3,2-1\n  siid-piid=value    Set props, e.g. m 2=#60,2-2=#false,3=test (# prefix for number/bool)\n  siid-aiid args     Do action, e.g. m 5 Hello or m 5-4 Hello #1\n\n  prop/get|prop/set|action <params>\n                    Raw MIoT call, params as JSON\n  /<uri> <data>     Raw MiIO call, e.g. m /home/device_list '{\"getVirtualModel\":false}'\n\nEXAMPLES\n  m login\n  m mina\n  m message Hello world\n  m play https://example.com/audio.mp3\n  m list\n  m list Light true 0\n  m spec speaker\n  m spec xiaomi.wifispeaker.lx04 json\n  m 1,1-2,2-1\n  m 2=#60\n  m 5 Hello\n"},
